  (descr "Broadcom Versatile Link horizontal module (HFBR-15x2Z / HFBR-25x2Z), per AV02-1501EN 'Printed Board Layout Dimensions': pins 1-4 at 2.54, pins 5 and 8 (mechanical, plated) 7.62 below pins 4 and 1, all holes 1.01 mm. Body 10.16 mm wide and centred on the pin row, so side-by-side modules interlock at 10.16 mm pitch. Pin 5/8 row must be >= 1.85 mm from the PCB edge (port overhangs the edge).")
